 \section*{Data and code availability}
-Code, manifests with file hashes and raw timing records are in the project repository \url{https://github.com/reikageisme/Sponge-patch-nms}. The repository contains the preregistration files with their version-control tags, the harness and analysis scripts, the manifests (code hash, library versions, CPU topology and power mode), the hash of every patch, the raw timing records of every run including rejected ones, and the figure scripts. Every numeric table is generated automatically from the summary files by a script in the repository, and a checking script compares every number in the tables and in the Results section with its source file.
